  "email": "varun@test.com",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### 🔑 AUTH — LOGIN (user not found — 404)
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════

POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nobody@test.com",
  "password": "test1234"
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### 🚪 AUTH — LOGOUT
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════

POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### 🔵 AUTH — GOOGLE (needs real credential)
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════

# POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/google
# Content-Type: application/json

# {
#   "credential": "YOUR_GOOGLE_ID_TOKEN_HERE"
# }


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### ⚫ AUTH — GITHUB (needs real code)
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════

# POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/github
# Content-Type: application/json

# {
#   "code": "YOUR_GITHUB_AUTH_CODE_HERE"
# }


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### 🎬 CONTENT — TRENDING
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════

### Get all trending content
GET {{baseUrl}}/content/trending

### Get trending movies only
GET {{baseUrl}}/content/trending?type=movie&limit=5

### Get trending games only
GET {{baseUrl}}/content/trending?type=game&limit=5


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### 🎬 CONTENT — SEARCH
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════

### Search content by title keyword (e.g. matrix)
GET {{baseUrl}}/content/search?query=matrix

### Search and filter by type (movies only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/content/search?query=fight&type=movie

### Search and filter by genre (e.g. Action)
GET {{baseUrl}}/content/search?genre=Action
